OL,3,GNEWSAPolice appeal after man assaulted
OL,4,Aoutside pub
OL,5,
OL,6,FPolice have asked for witnesses to come
OL,7,Fforward after a man was assaulted
OL,8,Foutside a pub in the west of the Isle
OL,9,Fof Man.
OL,11,FThe Isle of Man Constabulary said the
OL,12,Fattack happened outside the Peveril
OL,13,FPublic House in Peel at about 20:00 GMT
OL,14,Fon Wednesday.
OL,16,FNo further details about the assault or
OL,17,Fany injuries have been released.
OL,23,APub: 27-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB IOM NewsC Reg TVF Clean Feed
