OL,3,GNEWSAPolice appeal after man assaulted
OL,4,Aoutside pub
OL,5,
OL,6,FPolice have also called for any
OL,7,Fwitnesses who have not yet come forward
OL,8,Fto get in touch, particularly the
OL,9,Fdriver of a white vehicle parked at the
OL,10,Ffront of the pub, near to where the
OL,11,Fassault took place.
